[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mBefore using these checks on a real product, identify its band mapping, scale[m
[32m+[m[32mand offset, nodata values, quality-mask definition, and spatial/temporal[m
[32m+[m[32malignment. Write down which observations the statistic should include. The[m
[32m+[m[32mbinary flag and `[0,1]` rule above are choices for this exercise, not product[m
